    <string name="info_message">1. Donsela phansi uhlu lwamazinga ukuze uvuselele, kumbe usebenzise u-Vuselela Konke kumenyu. Ukuvuselela ngakunye kudla uhlamvu olulodwa.\n\n2. Amazinga ayazivuselela wodwa ngemuva. Izilungiselelo zilawula ukuthi kangaki, kumbe zikuvale.\n\n3. Faka inani kuloba yiyiphi imali ukuze uguqule usuka kuyo. Wonke amanye amazinga ayalandela.\n\n4. Thinta inkanyezi ukuze imali ihlale phezulu, kumbe uswayiphe ikhadi ukuze uyifihle. Imali efihliweyo ibuya ngemenyu.\n\n5. Sebenzisa inkinobho ethi + ukwengeza izinga lakho, lokho okungekho kuhlelo.\n\n6. Thinta ibizo lelizwe ngaphansi kwezinga ukuze ubone ukuthi livela ngaphi.\n\n7. Engeza iwijethi esikrinini sakho sekhaya ukuze ubone amazinga ungavulanga uhlelo.</string>
